*** Keywords ***
Perform feature delta commissioning if ASIL
        Run Keyword If      '${AP_HARDWARE}' == 'ASIL'  Perform recomissioning with delta
        ...                  path_to_delta=${CURDIR}${/}resources${/}deltas${/}delta_CA_ON_DRX_ON.json
        Run Keyword If      '${AP_HARDWARE}' == 'ASIL'
        ...                  Perform recomissioning with delta  path_to_delta=${CURDIR}${/}resources${/}deltas${/}delta_BF_ON_4DL2UL.json


Add debug mctrl flags if enabled
    ${debug_mctrl_enabled}=     Get Variable Value   ${DEBUG_MCTRL_ENABLED}
    Run Keyword If      ${debug_mctrl_enabled} == ${True}
    ...                 Add debug mctrl to swconfig
